  "label": "American Flag Symbolism: Represents patriotism, law enforcement, or national identity",
  "description": "The American flag in the background is used to evoke patriotism and national identity. In this context, it is often used to frame the police officer as a patriotic figure representing American values or law enforcement, which can be used to legitimize or glorify violent actions against perceived enemies (in this case, Muslims).",
